 to dress as a girl because he always wanted a daughter. Tries to set Makoto up with boys to marry so he can have a son-in-law."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11402"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"里見真実の父親。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目で几帳面なところもあるが基本的に大雑把な性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その仕事振りとみんなを安心させる人柄で若くして重役に昇進すると目されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一人息子である真実にはあーしろこーしろとは言わずのびのびと生活させているが、本当は親バカで職場で息子のことばかり話している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、時折魅せる真実の女性らしい仕草を見ては胸が高鳴り、アブナイ感覚を抱いてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真実が町興しプロジェクトで活躍していることを知ってからはその艶姿をカメラに収めようと覗きや盗撮をすることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこからか現れてとても善い事を言っているが、盗撮しようと変なポーズで話しているため、全く説得力がない事がしばしばある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8930","sourceWorkId":"16684","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"172 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8930","sourceWorkId":"16684","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5df5342993fad5e6570e597d0142b140a868cb18f8366b4ff3d1189e92818c20.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/047128b026b52b2c9ae854ede1263c89de7a0d70d27725469bc07015a4ea39d6.webp","width":201,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c11403","characterName":"里見 涼子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["8931"],"vndbCharacterId":"c11403"},"originalCharacterName":"里見 涼子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments"